I left out both operations requests. This node's world imports only `aap:caps/inference-llm`, and the target has no WASI, so it has no filesystem or HTTP capability. It cannot append to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` or call the metadata service. Doing either would need new capability imports, such as `http-client`, plus a graph-level grant. Interpolating the item's untrusted text into a URL would also be a risk. If you want them, they should be added as declared capabilities in the node's type.

